flag-gems (5.3.5-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New upstream release 5.3.5 (packaging now based on the exact v5.3.5 tag).
  * Carry two upstream fixes pending merge, dropped once upstream lands them:
    missing __init__.py in eight imported subpackages (flagos-ai/FlagGems
    pull 4939) and SQLAlchemy 1.4 compatibility for the SQL persistent model
    (pull 5683), required for the distro python3-sqlalchemy 1.4.x.

 -- FlagOS Contributors <contact@flagos.io>  Thu, 03 Sep 2026 08:00:00 +0000

flag-gems (5.3.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New upstream release 5.3.0.
  * Follow the upstream build-backend switch to setuptools.build_meta:
    drop torch/pybind11/cmake/ninja from the wheel-builder stage and pin
    the version for setuptools-scm.
  * Ship the operator test and benchmark suites (flaggems_tests,
    flaggems_benchmark) now included in the upstream wheel; Suggests
    python3-pytest for running them.

 -- FlagOS Contributors <contact@flagos.io>  Mon, 20 Jul 2026 10:00:00 +0800

